  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now the settings for TTT are in the `Quick Menu`, but to use it you need to use the `Action Menu`. This can be a bit annoying. Also right now to open the keyboard you need to first go in to the `Options` Category of the `Action Menu`.\n# Suggestion:\nAdd the `Clear Chatbox` and `Keyboard` to the Chatbox Category in the Quick Menu. There is still enough space to the left so it should be easily possible to put these two buttons there. (See Attachments below)\nIf not at lease please add a Tooltip saying that the button to open the Keyboard is in the Action Menu.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see how I could imagine it to look like:",
